way all of that money that the nearly $10 million that was raised, it was $9 million I believe at the time they announced it, that they were going to take it away and they were going to give it to other charities of their choosing. Not give it back to people like they've done with other conservative things that they've canceled. Instead, they were going to give it to their choosing of charities. And of course, when that happened, our very own Governor Ron DeSantis jumped on that and said, hold up, wait a minute, get on the floor. If you got the booty, I don't think so. Which once again just shows why you know the reason why you got to love Ron DeSantis. And I haven't checked the Ron be gone yet. Hang on, I got to take a look real quickly to see if they slammed on Governor DeSantis for this. Because usually they do. They're pretty good about slamming on him for everything. Let's see. Another waste of taxpayers' money and dog whistle to fundraise off of. That calling, you know, Rhonda Santis Madgate's caught misleading fans about GoFundMe over Freedom Convoy refund. Oh my God. This man is beyond corrupt. He is evil. Really? Rhonda Santis beyond corrupt and evil? I mean, there's been some things I haven't agreed with Governor DeSantis on, but I've yet to see anything that even remotely sounds like Governor DeSantis is corrupt. Let alone evil. Oh wait, you know what it is? I keep forgetting. It's because Rhonda Santis keeps",
