 I was extremely angry and heartbroken that this, that he had to deal with and, you know, he shouldn't have. And a social media post said Monday, Lucas's mother detailed the incident and shared a photo of the boy wearing the mask. The sub also said that he's never met one good police officer. All police officers do is look to get people in trouble.",
