    "turn_text": "Yeah, no kidding. Yeah, it's just insane to see that. And then of course, there's Dr. Fauci, which to me, I know that there's the argument of why didn't Donald Trump fire him when he had the opportunity. But then the question now is, with all the evidence that has come out, all the things that have happened, all of his contradictions, and then the other stuff on his personal side and his involvements and things, the question I think a lot of Americans have is, why is this guy still the face of the government's coronavirus?",
